OL,5,G0705 Undercover Boss USA
OL,6,     FThis episode follows Dippin' Dots,
OL,7,     Fwhich sells cryogenically frozen
OL,8,     Fbeads of ice cream. CEO Scott
OL,9,     FFischer wants to see if his empire
OL,10,     Fhas the manpower to cope with
OL,11,     Fexpansion.
OL,12,G0800 Undercover Boss USA
OL,13,     FAnytime Fitness is a global firm,
OL,14,     Fand it's the job of brand
OL,15,     Fpresident Stacy Anderson to keep
OL,16,     Fthis gym giant in shape. Are all
OL,17,     Fthe employees on board with the
OL,18,     Fplanned changes?
